{"id":2245,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深入践行全民健身理念，丰富教职工业余文化生活，营造健康向上、团结和谐的学院氛围，12月30日下午2:30，我院工会组织开展了本学期第四次集体活动——“教职工室内健身活动”。本次活动通过设置形式多样的室内运动项目，帮助教职工在锻炼中舒缓压力、增进交流、激发团队活力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rUzlIiL7CDoR9iM5z7ZU4Q2MzG4M8VCkLzGDnmMkLmCsolL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhVn1hkLkh2MmrfnRUsMzC8MlrfLRCboRM7UN7iMz7sUNnFUlVknRr2ozVFL47Zn7lJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsMmvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7767&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4EFB0F65AD475645EA06983DBA5517BD/AABD5F91/318DE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rU8UIaLz7ZnmAVM5zWRM4lanmWfMRLCYMz7PMNWRLz-aoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yan1yYL1y8nmUZnm9ZLRrVLNUZMzVRMzA2nNnVnmA2UmTFMRU4MmNaLmVFLll8UN78gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSysM4CsgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7767&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rMRLIPMzAfLzGiL5mLZnlWVUNl4MN-CDL8-bolUYUmLaMz70gihFp2hmCIa0UYhfUSyDnSyDUzCaUmrfLmVRUlCPUNWkUmvinN-4LR6kMmVFnmWfUz-iMRrFL8L8n7-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsMmvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7767&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CAA6E6A60B5A21CAF1BBBB75FB307B61/F2AA2545/3C4DB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=roRNIiLlUaMmW7U54vZLmCsLzlYU4NCYLz-4M8UPUz-iMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0oShVUYhkMSh7LmL4oRfRUmU4o7n2MRNDMzvPL49sMz-8LmWFnzlZLznfUNMFLm-8nzCZgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSysM4CsgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7767&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动现场设有乒乓球、跳绳、台球等多项趣味比赛与自由体验项目，教职工们踊跃参与、各展身手，在运动中释放热情，活动现场气氛轻松活跃。大家纷纷表示，此次健身活动不仅有效放松了身心，也为后续参与元旦联欢会营造了良好状态，起到了“热身”与凝聚人心的积极作用。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rUzlIiL7CDoR9iM5z7ZU4Q2MzG4M8VCkLzGDnmMkLmCsolL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhVn1hkLkh2MmrfnRUsMzC8MlrfLRCboRM7UN7iMz7sUNnFUlVknRr2ozVFL47Zn7lJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsMmvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7767&e=.jpg"}